Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 13:56:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Settings: Add switches to turn off blur

Two switches in Display > Appearance. Disable all blur sets
Settings.Global disable_window_blurs, the same setting as the blur
switch in Accessibility > Color and motion, which turns off window
blur everywhere: the notification panel, quick settings, lock screen,
recents and app dialogs. Disable panel blur sets Settings.Secure
sysui_shade_blur_disabled, which SystemUI reads to drop only the blur
behind the notification panel and quick settings. It is greyed out
while all blur is off.

Both are hidden on builds without cross-window blur support.

Change-Id: Ic80d182fe55dea15db29a80c1095168da9e834e5
